-- small-art-doll-tailor: fullDescription
UPDATE figurines
   SET full_description = $fx$This OOAK Tailor art doll is a tiny handmade character created with polymer clay and carefully selected fabric details. He is portrayed as a traditional tailor, surrounded by the little touches of his craft, giving the miniature a warm, nostalgic and wonderfully whimsical character.

Every detail is sculpted and finished by hand, from his expressive face and clothing to the tiny fabric elements that complete his appearance. The combination of polymer clay and real fabric gives this little figure a particularly tactile and authentic look.

The doll is approximately 10–12 cm tall. This is a one-of-a-kind handmade art piece, created as a collectible miniature rather than a toy. He would make a lovely addition to a collection of miniature characters, a sewing-themed display, or a unique gift for someone who loves handmade art, tailoring and charming little stories captured in sculpture.$fx$
 WHERE slug = 'small-art-doll-tailor'
   AND full_description IS NOT DISTINCT FROM $fx$This  OOAK Tailor art doll is a tiny handmade character created with polymer clay and carefully selected fabric details. He is portrayed as a traditional tailor, surrounded by the little touches of his craft, giving the miniature a warm, nostalgic and wonderfully whimsical character.

Every detail is sculpted and finished by hand, from his expressive face and clothing to the tiny fabric elements that complete his appearance. The combination of polymer clay and real fabric gives this little figure a particularly tactile and authentic look.

The doll is approximately 10–12 cm  tall. This is a one-of-a-kind handmade art piece, created as a collectible miniature rather than a toy. He would make a lovely addition to a collection of miniature characters, a sewing-themed display, or a unique gift for someone who loves handmade art, tailoring and charming little stories captured in sculpture.$fx$;

-- small-authors-doll-man-with-the-dog: fullDescription
UPDATE figurines
   SET full_description = $fx$OOAK Old Man with dog – Handmade Art Doll
(approximately 15–16 cm tall / about 6–6.3 inches)

This one-of-a-kind art doll is entirely hand-sculpted from polymer clay and carefully hand-painted with high-quality acrylic paints. Depicting a thoughtful old man accompanied by his faithful dog, this unique collectible captures a quiet moment of friendship, trust, and companionship.

Every detail has been crafted by hand, from his expressive face, weathered features, and long gray beard to his handmade clothing and tiny animal friend. The character's contemplative expression and gentle interaction with the dog suggest a story waiting to be told, inviting the viewer to imagine his life, travels, and adventures.

Built on a wire armature, the doll features movable limbs and is dressed in handcrafted clothing tailored specifically for this character. No molds are used in the creation process, making this a true OOAK (One of a Kind) collectible that can never be exactly duplicated.

Perfect for collectors of art dolls, fantasy characters, folk art, and literary-inspired miniatures, this piece brings warmth, personality, and storytelling charm to any display. Whether placed on a bookshelf, in a curio cabinet, or among a collection of unique handmade creations, it is sure to attract attention and spark curiosity.

The doll measures approximately 15–16 cm (6–6.3 inches) in height. It will be carefully packed in protective packaging and shipped with a tracking number. Please handle with care, as this is a delicate collectible art piece intended for display rather than play.$fx$
