-- small-doll-gnome-with-fancy-bag: fullDescription
UPDATE figurines
   SET full_description = $fx$Meet this curious little forest wanderer, dressed in rustic handmade clothes and carrying a large, colorful backpack filled with brushwood. With his tall crooked hat, expressive face, slightly tousled hair, and long pointed shoes, he looks as though he has been traveling through the woods for quite some time — and probably has a story or two to tell.

His oversized backpack is made from textured fabrics and decorated with colorful woven details, making a wonderful contrast to his simple dark clothing. He carries a natural wooden walking stick, giving him the appearance of an old-fashioned traveler who is always ready to continue his journey down another forest path.

The doll is entirely hand-sculpted and hand-painted, with every detail created individually. A wire armature inside allows the arms and legs to be moved slightly for posing. His rustic clothing, tall handmade hat, textured backpack, tiny buttons, pointed shoes, and natural wooden staff all contribute to his unique old-world character.

Approximately 10-11 cm tall, he would make a lovely addition to a fantasy or woodland collection, miniature display, diorama, dollhouse scene, or simply a special place on a shelf.

He is a true OOAK (One of a Kind) handmade art doll — there will never be another exactly like him.$fx$
 WHERE slug = 'small-doll-gnome-with-fancy-bag'
   AND full_description IS NOT DISTINCT FROM $fx$Meet this curious little forest wanderer, dressed in rustic handmade clothes and carrying a large, colorful backpack filled with mysterious treasures. With his tall crooked hat, expressive face, slightly tousled hair, and long pointed shoes, he looks as though he has been traveling through the woods for quite some time — and probably has a story or two to tell.

His oversized backpack is made from textured fabrics and decorated with colorful woven details, making a wonderful contrast to his simple dark clothing. He carries a natural wooden walking stick, giving him the appearance of an old-fashioned traveler who is always ready to continue his journey down another forest path.

The doll is entirely hand-sculpted and hand-painted, with every detail created individually. A wire armature inside allows the arms and legs to be moved slightly for posing. His rustic clothing, tall handmade hat, textured backpack, tiny buttons, pointed shoes, and natural wooden staff all contribute to his unique old-world character.

Approximately10-11 cm tall, he would make a lovely addition to a fantasy or woodland collection, miniature display, diorama, dollhouse scene, or simply a special place on a shelf.

He is a true OOAK (One of a Kind) handmade art doll — there will never be another exactly like him.$fx$;

