-- small-doll-witch-2: fullDescription
UPDATE figurines
   SET full_description = $fx$This little witch is a one-of-a-kind handmade art doll, sculpted in polymer clay and dressed in carefully crafted black fabric. She has an expressive face, a mischievous smile, wild gray hair and a tall, slightly crooked pointed hat that gives her a distinctive storybook character.

She carries a handmade broom made from natural fibers and a rustic branch, which adds to her traditional folklore appearance. Her black dress is finished with delicate details, while a small pendant hangs around her neck.

At approximately 10 cm (about 4 inches) tall, she is a tiny but highly detailed collectible sculpture. Her lively expression and slightly eccentric appearance make her feel like a character who has stepped out of an old fairy tale or folk story.

This witch is created as a collectible art doll and is intended for display rather than play. She would make a charming addition to a collection of fantasy and folklore characters, miniature sculptures, or handmade art dolls.$fx$
