-- small-doll-with-with-nest: fullDescription
UPDATE figurines
   SET full_description = $fx$OOAK Miniature Forest Witch Baba Yaga with Crow in Nest and Broom – Handmade Art Doll (approximately 10 cm / 3.9 inches tall)

This one-of-a-kind handmade art doll is entirely hand-sculpted and hand-painted, standing at approximately 10 cm (3.9 inches) tall. She features an extraordinarily expressive, characterful face with realistic wrinkles, intense eyes, and wild, textured gray hair woven with twigs and a tiny bird's nest perched on top, complete with a miniature black crow. 

Dressed by hand in a rustic, layered woodland ensemble, she wears an olive-green linen tunic, a dark apron, a tattered distressed shawl, and a vintage-style skull key pendant around her neck. She holds a handcrafted rustic wooden broom, perfect for her forest adventures. Built with an internal wire frame, her arms and legs are gently poseable for versatile styling. Every element is individually crafted and finished, ensuring that no two dolls are ever identical.   

This collectible miniature is ideal for OOAK art doll collectors, lovers of Slavic folklore, Baba Yaga enthusiasts, and fans of dark cottagecore or witchy décor. She makes an enchanting centerpiece for dollhouse displays, shadow boxes, curio cabinets, forest dioramas, and fairytale collections. As a delicate handmade art collectible, please handle her gently and keep her away from moisture, heat, and small children. Each order is carefully packed in protective packaging and ships with a tracking number included.  $fx$
 WHERE slug = 'small-doll-with-with-nest'
   AND full_description IS NOT DISTINCT FROM $fx$OOAK Miniature Forest Witch Baba Yaga with Crow in Nest and Broom – Handmade Art Doll (approximately 10 cm / 3.9 inches tall)

